WEBVTT

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:21.500
Read the guest’s request before choosing the ingredients.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:34.500
The checklist and flavour disc update as you select a base spirit and mixers.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:44.800
Shake the drink, then serve it to the guest.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:00.300
Four stages unlock more ingredients and additional layers of flavour feedback.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:08.000
Combine taste and aroma while checking the guest’s requirements.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Ingredient choices change the triangle’s shape and colour.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:39.000
Sparkling mixers add visible bubbles to the disc.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:46.500
Cream adds a flowing texture over the flavour triangle.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.000
Returning guests bring connected stories across seven nights.
